  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_jolo_to_person",
  "label": "jolo is mapped to the people at the dinner table",
  "description": "The text 'jolo' (a derogatory slang for 'jew' or 'jewel') is juxtaposed with the visual of people at a dinner table. This creates an analogical mapping where the group of people (visual entity) is being referred to or labeled by the text 'jolo' (textual entity), implying that the people depicted are being identified as 'jewels' or 'jews' in a dehumanizing context. This mapping is part of the antisemitic stereotype where Jewish people are reduced to objects or commodities.",
